Z||000000||Seanh||11-24-2000||07:39 PM||||I am still debating on seat colors to get from Mr. Mikes in my 86 GT. Could you do me a favor? I am hung between 4 different color choices for the 500 style seats. The first picture is the seat. Can you alter it to reflect the following color combos: Lite Gray w/red inserts, Dark Gray w/red inserts, Dark Gray w/Lite Gray inserts, Lite Gray w/Dark Gray inserts. Could you give me your opinions on them in the 86GT Gray interior? Thanks. Also, mind telling me, broadly, how you did it if you use PSP 6.0?<P>Style:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/500.gif"> <P>Red:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/3lobster.gif"> <P>Lite Gray:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/7ltgray.gif"> <P>Dark Gray/Regular Gray:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/8gray.gif"> ||||reg||1
